# Vercel Environment Variables Template
# Add these in Vercel dashboard: Project Settings > Environment Variables

# API Connection - Update after Railway backend is deployed
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app.up.railway.app

# Calendly Integration
VITE_CALENDLY_URL=https://calendly.com/warriorforge/book

# Instructions:
# 1. Deploy backend to Railway first
# 2. Copy the Railway app URL (e.g., https://your-app.up.railway.app)
# 3. Set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your Railway URL
# 4. Update CALENDLY_URL with your actual Calendly link
# 5. Add these in Vercel: Settings > Environment Variables > Production
